'''Sun Fac'''<ref name="GOH" /> was an upper-caste [[Geonosian]] who lived in the [[Stalgasin hive]] on [[Geonosis]].<ref name="AOC" /> He served as chief [[lieutenant]] to [[Archduke]] [[Poggle the Lesser]]<ref name="CVD">''[[Star Wars: The Complete Visual Dictionary, New Edition]]''</ref> and acted as Poggle's personal enforcer,<ref name="NantexCard">{{FFGXW2|set=Nantex-class Starfighter Expansion Pack|cardname=Sun Fac}}</ref> ensuring that his master's will was carried out across Geonosis. He was unusually intelligent and creative for his [[species]] and possessed the versatility to play whatever role was required to increase productivity, ranging from a sympathetic listener to a heartless [[Death penalty|executioner]].<ref name="CVD" /> A renowned warrior, Fac armed himself with a [[Geonosian sonic blaster]] and used a [[force pike]] in hand-to-hand combat.<ref name="Stats to Scene">{{AtomicMassGames|url=transmission/scene-to-stats-sun-fac-poggle-the-lesser|text=Scene to Stats: Sun Fac & Poggle the Lesser}}</ref> During the [[First Battle of Geonosis]]<ref name="NantexCard" /> in [[22 BBY]],<ref name="Death" /> Fac piloted a [[Nantex-class territorial defense starfighter|''Nantex''-class starfighter]] and shot down a [[Galactic Republic]] [[Low Altitude Assault Transport/infantry]].<ref name="NantexCard" /> Fac then tried to avoid capture by the Republic as the battle carried on. During that effort, however, Fac was [[Death|killed]].<ref name="The Separatists" />

==Behind the scenes==
Sun Fac first appeared, albeit unnamed, in the [[2002]] [[prequel trilogy]] film {{Film|II}}.<ref name="AOC" /> In [[canon]], Sun Fac was first identified by name in the [[2015]] mobile [[Star Wars video games|video game]] ''[[Star Wars: Galaxy of Heroes]]'',<ref name="swgoh">[[Star Wars: Galaxy of Heroes]]</ref> to which he was added on [[April 24]], [[2016]].<ref name="swgohadded">{{EA|subdomain=forums.galaxy-of-heroes.starwars|url=discussion/31642/game-update-4-24-2016-part-1|text=Game Update - 4/24/2016 PART 1}}</ref>

